  "body_html": "<h1>loomis_theorem</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem loomis_theorem (A B : I → J → ℝ) (hB : IsPositive B) : ∃ (x : stdSimplex ℝ I) (y : stdSimplex ℝ J) (v : ℝ), (∀ j, v * xB B x j ≤ xA A x j) ∧ (∀ i, Ay A y i ≤ v * By B y i)</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>IsPositive</li>\n<li>exists_xx_lamB0</li>\n<li>exists_yy_muB0</li>\n<li>loomis_value_eq</li>\n<li>wsum_const</li>\n<li>Profile.ext</li>\n</ul>",
